test.yaml:10:24: "github.event.pull_request.title" is potentially untrusted. avoid using it directly in inline scripts. instead, pass it through an environment variable. see https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#good-practices-for-mitigating-script-injection-attacks for more details [expression]
test.yaml:11:28: 'actions/stale@v9' is not pinned to a full-length commit SHA. see https://github.com/actions/stale/tree/v9 (fixable with --fix --enable-pin-network) [action]
test.yaml:16:36: 'actions/github-script@v7' is not pinned to a full-length commit SHA. see https://github.com/actions/github-script/tree/v7 (fixable with --fix --enable-pin-network) [action]
