test.yaml:22:31: "github.event.*.body" is potentially untrusted. avoid using it directly in inline scripts. instead, pass it through an environment variable. see https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#good-practices-for-mitigating-script-injection-attacks for more details [expression]
